# 局内存盘时写方式打开失败一次（盘满）：这次提交被拒并提示玩家，存档容器照常卸载（715ed80 修的剪口），下一次存盘两边都提交
# A write-mode open fails once during an in-game save (full disk): that commit is refused and the player is told, the save container is unmounted as usual (the cut fixed by 715ed80), and the next save commits both sides
name ingame_open_fails
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
fault arm guestopen
save_now wait=0
expect save result=rejected timeout=10
expect_state save_mounted=0 timeout=10
sleep 1
save_now timeout=8
quit
check event fault point=guestopen
check event save_alert
check no_event save_stuck
check saved
